# システム環境設定's 〈電源管理〉 as 利用者 on the x64 PC (tools/x64/ui_run64.py): tools/tests/ui_sysenv.steps
# with the processors' clock left to the firmware. The limit is not offered (its selector is off and the
# line under it says the firmware sets the speed), 設定 keeps the watchdog alone and writes no CPU_MHZ,
# and the kernel says once that CPU_MHZ is not used. The window is at 160,80: the tab 電源管理 at
# 282,151; the limit's 最大 at 583,383 (pressed: nothing changes); ウォッチドッグ's switch at 390,548,
# its seconds at 465,548, and 設定 at 708,548. Ctrl+E closes.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
expect sysenv: settings CPU_MHZ 1800 WATCHDOG 30
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 282 151
wait 500
expect sysenv: clock （不明）
shot se_power
# the limit cannot be chosen; a minute for the watchdog
click 583 383
click 465 548
key 2a
key 2a
key 2a
text 60
wait 300
click 708 548
expect sysenv: performance CPU_MHZ -1 WATCHDOG 60 (0)
expect watchdog on: reset 60 s
shot se_wd60
# opened again: as kept, and still no limit
key 08 01
expect sysenv: closed
# its pages filled (the faces read take a while) before anything is pressed
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expectsince sysenv: ready
expect sysenv: settings CPU_MHZ 1800 WATCHDOG 60
wait 800
click 282 151
wait 500
shot se_again
# back as the machine came: 30 seconds
click 465 548
key 2a
key 2a
key 2a
text 30
wait 300
click 708 548
expect sysenv: performance CPU_MHZ -1 WATCHDOG 30 (0)
expect watchdog on: reset 30 s
wait 1000
key 08 01
wait 500
absent cpu: limit
absent !OACV!
